* Physical AI - Experiment 10: hardware-constrained A
* Frozen Experiment 9 weights. Mapping: 1k-1M shared Gw1=0.000462 Gb1=0.0376 Gw2=0.000462 Gb2=0.0376
* Weights were not edited. Resistors are not clipped.
* Hidden: precision ReLU. Output: linear.
* Signed weights: G+/G- paths, I_diff = I+ - I- by KCL in SPICE.
* Bias: separate ammeter path + CCCS gain k=G_WEIGHT/G_BIAS so V_b = b. Vref remains 1 V.
* G_WEIGHT_1=0.000462350248977133 G_BIAS_1=0.0375956862601456 k1=0.0122979600845127
* G_WEIGHT_2=0.000462350248977133 G_BIAS_2=0.0375956862601456 k2=0.0122979600845127
* R_IV_1=2162.86246673884 R_IV_2=2162.86246673884
* Layer voltages stay in neural units (no inter-layer Python rescale).
* shape: 2 -> 4 -> 1

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
Vref vref 0 DC 1

* --- neuron h1 ---
* separate bias path: I_b_injected = k * Vref * G_B * |b|, k=G_W/G_B=0.0122979600845127
* so V_b = I_b_injected / G_W = |b|  (math bias unchanged)
* h1 input 1 w=+0.683760795348816 w+  G = 0.000316136973970327 S  R = 3163.18584138108 Ohm
Rh1p1 in1 h1p 3163.18584138108
* h1 input 2 w=+0.309366783045794 w+  G = 0.000143035809166478 S  R = 6991.25628629201 Ohm
Rh1p2 in2 h1p 6991.25628629201
* h1 bias=-0.0265987962576462 b-  G = 0.000999999999 S  R = 1000.000001 Ohm
Rh1bn vref h1biasn 1000.000001
Vh1bbn h1biasn 0 DC 0
Fh1bbn h1d 0 Vh1bbn 0.0122979600845127
Vh1p h1p 0 DC 0
Vh1n h1n 0 DC 0
Fh1p 0 h1d Vh1p 1
Fh1n h1d 0 Vh1n 1
Vh1d h1d 0 DC 0
Hh1 h1lin 0 Vh1d 2162.86246673884
Bh1 h1amp 0 V = max(-15, min(15, 100000 * v(h1lin, h1y)))
Dh1 h1amp h1y Dsi
RLh1 h1y 0 10000
Eh1 h1buf 0 h1y 0 1

* --- neuron h2 ---
* separate bias path: I_b_injected = k * Vref * G_B * |b|, k=G_W/G_B=0.0122979600845127
* so V_b = I_b_injected / G_W = |b|  (math bias unchanged)
* h2 input 1 w=-0.884821731731664 w-  G = 0.000409097547966513 S  R = 2444.40477575743 Ohm
Rh2n1 in1 h2n 2444.40477575743
* h2 input 2 w=+0.782653240240456 w+  G = 0.000361859920487935 S  R = 2763.50030324329 Ohm
Rh2p2 in2 h2p 2763.50030324329
* h2 bias=+5.94215208512688e-05 b+  G = 2.233992855025e-06 S  R = 447629.005504948 Ohm
Rh2bp vref h2biasp 447629.005504948
Vh2bbp h2biasp 0 DC 0
Fh2bbp 0 h2d Vh2bbp 0.0122979600845127
Vh2p h2p 0 DC 0
Vh2n h2n 0 DC 0
Fh2p 0 h2d Vh2p 1
Fh2n h2d 0 Vh2n 1
Vh2d h2d 0 DC 0
Hh2 h2lin 0 Vh2d 2162.86246673884
Bh2 h2amp 0 V = max(-15, min(15, 100000 * v(h2lin, h2y)))
Dh2 h2amp h2y Dsi
RLh2 h2y 0 10000
Eh2 h2buf 0 h2y 0 1

* --- neuron h3 ---
* separate bias path: I_b_injected = k * Vref * G_B * |b|, k=G_W/G_B=0.0122979600845127
* so V_b = I_b_injected / G_W = |b|  (math bias unchanged)
