Bh3 h3amp 0 V = max(-15, min(15, 100000 * v(h3lin, h3y)))
Dh3 h3amp h3y Dsi
RLh3 h3y 0 10000
Eh3 h3buf 0 h3y 0 1

* --- neuron h4 ---
* separate bias path: I_b_injected = k * Vref * G_B * |b|, k=G_W/G_B=0.0122979600845127
