Rh4n1 in1 h4n 1000.000001
* h4 input 2 w=+0.726967919426763 w+  G = 0.000336113798545352 S  R = 2975.18282298389 Ohm
Rh4p2 in2 h4p 2975.18282298389
* h4 bias=-0.0184151286231249 b-  G = 0.000692329398155231 S  R = 1444.39915835523 Ohm
Rh4bn vref h4biasn 1444.39915835523
